{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018171215914-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018171215\"/><p>巴士撼毀鐵欄，車頭受損。</p><p>東涌發生交通意外。今日(18日)下午2時49分，一輛龍運巴士在航天城的巴士總站行駛期間，懷疑在彎位失控撞向鐵欄，幸好無人受傷。網上圖片顯示，巴士車頭受損，泵把甩脫，部分鐵欄被撞至凹陷。警員到場調查後，初步懷疑是車長誤踩油門肇禍。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:19:31.312165+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:12:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:34.976635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:34.976635+00:00","content_hash":"8a0c1873c3a1527efcf52fdf7c9d3051a2e70be279daaf7e118ac0d1145c5095","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}